            "text": "Stored XSS — Requires further review: Customer Feedback API (/api/Feedbacks)\n\nAPI endpoint exists with feedback comments. Existing feedback entries contain unescaped HTML tags (<b>, <br />, <em>) in stored data, indicating HTML is not sanitized. However, submission requires CAPTCHA validation which prevents direct API submission. Frontend form submission could not be completed without bypassing CAPTCHA. Reachability of XSS payload execution unconfirmed - would require successful feedback submission followed by rendering verification."
